    "body": "My attempt:\r\n\r\n> For content attributes which have such reflected IDL attributes, specification authors must instead use the reflected target's attr-associated element or attr-associated elements respectively. The content attribute values themselves must not be used, as they can contain values that are out of sync with what the web developer has set via the reflected IDL attributes.",
